	quest.07BF58D8D865F30F.quest_subtitle: "For a better life"
	quest.07BF58D8D865F30F.title: "Divers Item"
	quest.0924A748A559208A.quest_desc: ["The Pink Collector [MK5] will generate 640 EMC/s, +150 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 10 240 EMC/s."]
	quest.0924A748A559208A.title: "Collector MK5"
	quest.0AF88D0E72C1A652.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Regigigas you must first summon Regirock, Regice, Registeel, Regieleki and Regidrago using their pedestals, where by doing so you will obtain a total of 5 Tablets (\"Regirock Tablet\", \"Regice Tablet\", \"Registeel Tablet\", \"Regieleki Tablet\" and \"Regidrago Tablet\") and by combining these 5 tablets you will obtain a \"Titan Key\"."
		""
		"Once you have the \"Titan Key\", you can unlock the \"Regigigas Lock\" found in Snowpoint Temple (you can track it using the Arc Phone). Behind the lock will be a simple hallway path that leads to the Sanctuary Block for you to deactivate, a Library room with lots of loot and Regigigas' summon room."
		""
		"In the summon room, step on each circle to light it up. Once each circle is lit, a level 70 Regigigas will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Titan Core\" upon lighting the floor which you can use to craft the Titan Pauldron or Titan Hammer."
	]
	quest.0AF88D0E72C1A652.title: "Regigigas"
	quest.0CECFD0E43810023.quest_desc: ["Craft a Hepatizon Seed."]
	quest.0DDB0D02097667F7.quest_desc: ["7 498 258 784 EMC in this Violet Matter."]
	quest.0DE82070B7246F89.quest_desc: [
		"The Gem armor is the last tier armor from ProjectE. "
		"This armor has some functions with it:"
		""
		"Step Assist on the boots."
		"Night vision on the helmet."
		"You can partially fly by holding the jump button."
	]
	quest.0DE82070B7246F89.title: "Gem Armor"
	quest.10851F30E823445B.quest_desc: [
		"Any items placed in the inventory will be destroyed and converted to EMC which is then stored in the internal buffer."
		"It can receives EMC energy from an adjacent Energy Collector or Anti-Matter Relay."
	]
	quest.11C4D311ED4D8843.quest_desc: ["Refined Storage can also be accessed Wirelessly. You need the Transmitter and then a wireless grid of some sort. We'd recommend the wireless crafting grid."]
	quest.1309A5D9E29B16E9.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Kyurem you must first summon Reshiram and Zekrom using their pedestals, where by doing so you will obtain 2 bottles \"Truth Bottle\" and \"Ideals Bottle\"."
		""
		"Once you have both bottles, you need to find the Kyurem Cave (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and use both bottles at the Kyurem Pedestals and a level 60 Kyurem will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.1309A5D9E29B16E9.title: "Kyurem"
	quest.14969C0220EDE356.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Giratina you must find the Giratina Island (you can track it using the Arc Phone). This is a huge island that can be found in the Distortion World."
		""
		"Once you reach the Giratina Pedestal and use a \"Griseous Orb\", a level 70 Giratina will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Antimatter Globe\" upon using the pedestal, which you'll be able to put together with the other 2 Globes and a Celestica Flute to craft the \"Azure Flute\" to obtain Arceus."
	]
	quest.14969C0220EDE356.title: "Giratina"
	quest.161EA7AE50C02925.quest_desc: ["Once you have a Wireless Transmitter, you can extend the range with these boosters. 4 will fit in one Transmitter."]
	quest.1659FADFB3F2F547.quest_desc: ["Craft some Tornium Essence with Lightium Essence."]
	quest.1659FADFB3F2F547.title: "Tornium Essence"
	quest.167FC2DBB5854EB4.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Ho-Oh you must first summon Raikou, Entei and Suicune using their pedestals, where by doing so you will obtain a total of 3 feathers \"Blue Feather\", \"Yellow Feather\" and \"Red Feather\", and by combining these 3 feathers you will obtain a \"Rainbow Feather\"."
		""
		"Once you have the feather, you need to find the Bell Tower (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and once you finish the parkour and reach the top, you can use the \"Rainbow Feather\" at the Ho-Oh Pedestal and a level 60 Ho-Oh will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.167FC2DBB5854EB4.title: "Ho-Oh"
	quest.177AB3FDB327BEA5.quest_desc: ["Craft a Fiery Ingot Seed."]
	quest.178E9A02E17ECE6C.quest_desc: [
		"You wanna gamble ? There is the best way to do it."
		""
		"5 relics coin required. "
	]
	quest.178E9A02E17ECE6C.title: "Items Gacha"
	quest.19256785AFE6AEB1.quest_desc: ["The Blue Collector [MK8] will generate 40 960 EMC/s, +15 000 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 655 360 EMC/s."]
	quest.19256785AFE6AEB1.title: "Collector MK8"
	quest.1994A3D47696F20E.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Victini you need to find an \"Liberty Pass\", which has a 25% of being found in Desert Temple chests."
		""
		"Once you have the pass, you need to find the Liberty Garden (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and use the pass on the Victini Lock and a level 60 Victini will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.1994A3D47696F20E.title: "Victini"
	quest.1A1C4B4C1B2011CC.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Latios you need to craft a \"Latios Treat\", for which you will require multiple cobblemon berries and a \"Poketreat Box\" which the Entrepreneur Villager sometimes sells."
		""
		"Once you have the treat, you need to find the Southern Island (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and place the treat at the Lati Pedestal and a level 50 Latios will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"Keep in mind that Latias and Latios share their pedestal, and you must choose between one or the other, and to obtain the other you will have to find another island."
	]
	quest.1A1C4B4C1B2011CC.title: "Latios"
	quest.1AABCB1499E3C71C.quest_desc: ["To obtain this, you have to craft clay ball with bone meal."]
	quest.1ABFA18577DC3ED4.quest_desc: ["Craft a Queen's Slime Seed."]
	quest.1ADF0602A0FC83E1.quest_desc: ["With oak barrel, you can have water (wait rain or put some saplings or leave in oak crucible)"]
	quest.1CA8510A0A2038F7.quest_desc: [
		"As I already said, your Pokemon Adventure will start in other dimension. "
		""
		"Before, you have to craft your trainer card. "
		""
		"Keep it in hands (main or offhand) and an arrow will appear. "
		""
		"Follow this one and trade your card by an other called \"diamond shining\"."
		""
		"At the beggining, your pokemon can't be more than level 15."
		""
		"Follow the next arrows and defeat all other trainers to augment your level cap."
		""
		"Good luck trainers"
	]
	quest.1CE3FFD826D40F41.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Ting-Lu you must collect by right-clicking, 8 \"Groundblight Stakes\" which you can find in any biome in The Nether."
		""
		"Once you have collected at least 8 \"Groundblight Stakes\" you can interact with a Groundblight Shrine (you can track it using the Arc Phone) in The Nether, to summon a level 50 Ting-Lu, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.1D9D9E8C50DFCFD8.quest_desc: ["Craft an Apatite Seed."]
	quest.20A13953035A1815.quest_desc: ["The Transmutation Table functions as a battery for EMC energy, a charger for EMC storage items, as a library of blueprints and as a fabricator of items."]
	quest.220B3D3B4ECA3593.quest_desc: [
		"To go on Cobblemon Dimension, you have to craft teleporter."
		""
		"Left click to teleport you. "
		""
		"Warning: in this dimension you'll be always randomly teleported, so if you discover a legendary structure, put a waypoint."
		""
		"Cobblemon Dimension don't have mobs (hostiles/passives), don't have ores (it's cheating on skyblock :D)"
	]
	quest.23185A54FEB337C5.quest_desc: [
		"Destroy leaves with crook to have silkworm."
		""
		"Use silkworms on leave to infect them."
	]
	quest.2481870BC1E14A35.quest_desc: ["Now that you have a crafter, you need a Pattern Grid to create crafting patterns for your system."]
	quest.2496AB86EC974CBF.quest_desc: [
		"Philosopher's Stone is the starting point to start using EMC."
		""
		""
	]
	quest.24B71ACFC5314494.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Heatran you must find the Heatran Cave in The Nether (you can track it using the Arc Phone). This cave is huge and has tons of chests and hidden chests that can give you amazing loot."
		""
		"Once you reach the Heatran Pedestal and use a \"Magma Stone\" that can be crafted with 7 magma blocks and 2 netherite scraps, a level 50 Heatran will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.24B71ACFC5314494.title: "Heatran (not created)"
	quest.2568CCE74F8EF8AD.quest_desc: ["Red Matter armor is the second tier armor from ProjectE."]
	quest.2568CCE74F8EF8AD.title: "Red Matter Armor"
	quest.277C67300013535A.quest_desc: ["To obtain Zamazenta you must find the Shield Temple (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and by using a \"Totem of Undying\" and a \"Rusted Shield\" (which you can craft or download datapacks available at the Mega Showdown Discord that add other ways to obtain it) at the Zamazenta Pedestals a level 60 Zamazenta will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."]
	quest.277C67300013535A.title: "Zamazenta"
	quest.27F008223F162C08.quest_desc: ["The Final Collector [MK16] will generate 1 Trillion EMC/s, +1 Trillion EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 9.2 Quintillion EMC/s."]
	quest.27F008223F162C08.title: "Final Collector MK16"
	quest.297714F52A1046EC.quest_desc: ["There are storage blocks you could use with RS as well, but the Disk Drive allows you to add multiple disks into one block, so that's what we recommend you use."]
	quest.29A643706EF0F496.quest_desc: ["Dark Matter Armor is the first tier armor from ProjectE."]
	quest.29A643706EF0F496.title: "Dark Matter Armor"
	quest.2A521475F1678153.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Darkrai you must craft a and use \"Newmoon Whistle\" using 5 \"Nightmare Essences\" obtained by sleeping with the \"Lucid Dreaming effect\" granted by sleeping near a \"Dream Catcher\", but be careful as having a nightmare will be painful."
		""
		"Once you have the whistle just right-click with it in your hand and a level 50 Darkrai will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.2A521475F1678153.title: "Darkrai"
	quest.2A6795DAF0C1E7AE.quest_desc: [
		"When you'll go to the cobblemon dimension, you'll see all your pokemon can't go more that level 15."
		""
		"For upgrade this, you have to craft a Trainer Card, hold in hand (main hand or offhand) and sometimes, an arrow will show you direction. "
		""
		"You'll face a NPC can trade somes things. "
		"Trade your trainer card for a diamond/shining card."
		""
		"One more time, keep your new trainer card in hands and wait the arrow appear. All the next NPC you'll see, will be trainers. "
		""
		"Defeat them to evolve your level cap. "
	]
	quest.2B43D87607383C49.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Chi-Yu you must collect by right-clicking, 8 \"Firescourge Stakes\" which you can find in any biome in The Nether."
		""
		"Once you have collected at least 8 \"Firescourge Stakes\" you can interact with a Firescourge Shrine (you can track it using the Arc Phone) in The Nether, to summon a level 50 Chi-Yu, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.2DFB0BAC53846BCB.quest_desc: [
		"Silicon is obtained by smelting Nether Quartz. You'll need a ton if you want infinite storage disks. A. Ton."
		""
		"You can also get a Silicon Bee or Silicon Seeds to increase (and automate) production"
	]
	quest.2E575AE1FEBD8C5C.quest_desc: ["Craft some Lightium Essence with Ornium Essence."]
	quest.2E575AE1FEBD8C5C.title: "Lightium Essence"
	quest.33ACBBFD55C6F973.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Wo-Chien you must collect by right-clicking, 8 \"Grasswither Stakes\" which you can find in any biome in The Nether."
		""
		"Once you have collected at least 8 \"Grasswither Stakes\" you can interact with a Grasswither Shrine (you can track it using the Arc Phone) in The Nether, to summon a level 50 Wo-Chien, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.33ACBBFD55C6F973.title: "Wo-Chien (not created)"
	quest.33CEB7EBC653000A.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Lugia you must first summon Articuno, Zapdos and Moltres using the Urns, where by doing so you will obtain a total of 3 stones \"Arctic Stone\", \"Zap Stone\" and \"Molten Stone\", and by combining these 3 stones on a crafting table, you will obtain a \"Vortex Stone\"."
		""
		"Once you have the stone, you need to find the Lugia Temple (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and use the stone to open the temple's door. Grab the stone again, and proceed to complete the maze and use the \"Vortex Stone\" at the Lugia Pedestal and a level 60 Lugia will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.33CEB7EBC653000A.title: "Lugia"
	quest.33CF6E836C2CDD22.quest_desc: ["Craft a Steeleaf Seed."]
	quest.35F06DF31BCCCCF1.quest_desc: [
		"The Controller is the heart of the RS system."
		""
		"Since Storage Drawers are in the pack, these two mods work great with each other for all your storage needs! Simply use an External Storage connector on your drawer controller and all connected drawers should be accessible from the system. (Don't forget to set your priority on the connector)"
	]
	quest.35F06DF31BCCCCF1.title: "RS Controller"
	quest.3796EF5E4274C286.quest_desc: ["Craft a Knightmetal Seed."]
	quest.37FC2C9D3C60678C.quest_desc: ["The White Collector [MK14] will generate 167 772 160 EMC/s, +61 440 000 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 2 684 354 560 EMC/s."]
	quest.37FC2C9D3C60678C.title: "Collector MK14"
	quest.39B341DDBA9E1041.quest_desc: ["The Alchemical Chest is a large chest, capable of holding 104 stacks of items."]
	quest.3B8B8462651B6D2A.quest_desc: ["Craft some Ouranium Essence with Tornium Essence."]
	quest.3B8B8462651B6D2A.title: "Ouranium Essence"
	quest.3BB12DA16638F436.quest_desc: ["The Yellow Collector [MK12] will generate 10 485 760 EMC/s, +3 840 000 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 167 772 160 EMC/s."]
	quest.3BB12DA16638F436.title: "Collector MK12"
	quest.3C5E9666B9E581EB.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Mew you need to find an \"Old Sea Map\", which has a 50% of being found in Jungle Temple chests. (note: Old Sea Map does not function as a Minecraft map)"
		""
		"Once you have the map, you need to find the Final Island (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and place the map at the Mew Pedestal and a level 40 Mew will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.3C5E9666B9E581EB.title: "Mew"
	quest.3D52243AA2CFB03A.quest_desc: [
		"This block will allow you to hook up your EMC \"Network\" with Refined Storage, allowing you to craft with items in the table without having to put them into the system."
		""
		"Simply use an External Storage connector on the Transmutation Interface and you should be able to pull any EMCable items right from the system"
	]
	quest.40451083E9066147.quest_desc: ["The Fading Collector [MK15] will generate 671 088 640 EMC/s, +245 760 000 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 10 737 418 240 EMC/s."]
	quest.40451083E9066147.title: "Collector MK15"
	quest.40F9A1C80B34B91B.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Regice you need an \"Ice Golem Key\" craftable with 1 Ice Gem and 4 \"Ice Golem Ingots\". A batch of 4 \"Ice Golem Ingots\" is crafted using 1 Ice Gem and 4 \"Golem Scraps\" from furnace smelting \"Ancient Rubble\" found when sieving gravel in netherite mesh."
		""
		"Once you have an \"Ice Golem Key\", you can unlock the \"Regice Lock\" found in Snowpoint Temple (you can track it using the Arc Phone). Behind the lock will be a trial consisting of a Powder Snow maze where some walls you may pass through, and others you may not. There is a secret vault with loot in this maze and a sinkable powder snow trap right before the end. Beyond the trap leads to Regice's summon room."
		""
		"In the summon room, step on each circle to light it up. Once each circle is lit, a level 40 Regice will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Registeel Tablet\" upon lighting the floor which can be combined with the other 4 Tablets to craft the \"Titan Key\", so you can obtain Regigigas."
	]
	quest.40F9A1C80B34B91B.title: "Regice"
	quest.40FBA60FCAE9B1D7.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Zekrom you need to craft a \"Dark Stone\", for which you will require 9 \"Dark Stone Shards\" which you can obtain by either killing dragon-type pokemon (the higher the evolution, the more likely) or guranteed by killing Wardens and Wither Bosses."
		""
		"Once you have the \"Dark Stone\", you need to find the Dragonspiral Tower (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and place the stone and a \"Electric Gem\" in each Zekrom Pedestal and a level 60 Zekrom will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Ideals Bottle\" upon using the pedestals, which you'll be able to use along side the \"Truth Bottle\" to obtain Kyurem."
	]
	quest.40FBA60FCAE9B1D7.title: "Zekrom"
	quest.41676E44896913C8.quest_desc: ["The Ornium Coal will smelt 768 items."]
	quest.435EBB1818B764EC.quest_desc: ["Break cobblestone with hammer to obtain gravel"]
	quest.440B92979D9578D4.quest_desc: ["Look easy for you!"]
	quest.444F42573049A74F.quest_desc: ["Shift+right click on dirt will give you pebbles"]
	quest.4505FF53E440A4C1.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Eternatus you must find the Eternatus Cocoon in The End (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and give to the huge cocoon block in it a total of 500 \"Galar Particles\", which are a new ore that spawns in the overworld and works as fuel and bone meal."
		""
		"Once you've given the 500 particles, just right-click the Cocoon Block and a level 70 Eternatus will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.4505FF53E440A4C1.title: "Eternatus"
	quest.454A87052AC7B74A.quest_desc: ["The Cyan Collector [MK9] will generate 163 840 EMC/s, +60 000 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 2 621 440 EMC/s."]
	quest.454A87052AC7B74A.title: "Collector MK9"
	quest.461388C5733A7690.quest_desc: ["The Tornium Coal will smelt 3 072 items."]
	quest.46F6DA67AE70702F.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Keldeo you must first summon Cobalion, Terrakion and Virizion by collecting their footprints, where by doing so you will obtain a total of 3 ingredients: \"Special Meat Chunks\", \"Special Spices\", and \"Special Leafy Greens\". By combining these 3 ingredients, you will obtain the \"Curry of Justice\"."
		""
		"Once you have the \"Curry of Justice\", just right-click with it in your hand and a level 50 Keldeo will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.46F6DA67AE70702F.title: "Keldeo"
	quest.47162904CEFB7D25.quest_desc: [
		"Punch the tree."
		""
		"You have the mod FTB ultimate to easily collect ressources."
	]
	quest.4A3105C5AEBBC9DE.quest_desc: ["Craft a Draconium Seed."]
	quest.4A8326BAF72088E2.quest_desc: [
		"There you gamble all things like balls, held items, evolutions items. "
		""
		"Yes 20 relics can be worth!"
	]
	quest.4D67A116DEA51181.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Reshiram you need to craft a \"Light Stone\" using 9 \"Light Stone Shards\" obtained by either killing dragon-type pokemon (the higher the evolution, the more likely) or guranteed by killing Wardens and Wither Bosses."
		""
		"Once you have the \"Light Stone\", you need to find the Dragonspiral Tower (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and place the stone and a \"Fire Gem\" in each Reshiram Pedestal and a level 60 Reshiram will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Truth Bottle\" upon using the pedestals, which you'll be able to use along side the \"Ideals Bottle\" to obtain Kyurem."
	]
	quest.4D67A116DEA51181.title: "Reshiram"
	quest.4D8E4EED739515E8.quest_desc: ["Fire unfired crucible on furnace to obtain fired crucible. "]
	quest.4E32A67A7BB05B15.quest_desc: ["Craft a Manyullyn Seed."]
	quest.4EFDEC6C535D91B2.quest_desc: ["Quartz Enriched Iron is the basic crafting ingredient for Refined Storage. You'll need quite a lot of this going forward."]
	quest.501751C198CB4AAD.quest_desc: ["Craft a Cobalt Seed."]
	quest.50EF3725C690FC51.quest_desc: ["The Purple Collector [MK6] will generate 2 560 EMC/s, +750 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 40 960 EMC/s."]
	quest.50EF3725C690FC51.title: "Collector MK6"
	quest.51FAD5E26134E133.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Terrakion you must collect by right-clicking, 50 \"Terrakion Footprints\" which you can find in any biome in the overworld."
		""
		"Once you collect your 50th footprint a level 40 Terrakion will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive \"Special Spices\" upon summoning Terrakion, which you'll be able to put together with the other 2 ingredients from Virizion and Cobalion to craft the \"Curry of Justice\" to obtain Keldeo."
	]
	quest.51FAD5E26134E133.title: "Terrakion (not created)"
	quest.52A06CDA0FC6A1E7.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Arceus you must summon Dialga, Palkia, and Giratina using their pedestals, where by doing so you will obtain a total of 3 Globes \"Time Globe\", \"Space Globe\" and \"Antimatter Globe\", and by combining these 3 Globes with a \"Celestica Flute\" you will obtain an \"Azure Flute\"."
		""
		"Celestica Flute can be traded from Master Level Entrepreneur Villager or reward from vaults found in &nTurnback Cave&m"
		""
		"Once you have the \"Azure Flute\", just right-click with it in your hand and you will be taken to the Hall of Origin dimension. Atop the stairs you load into, a level 80 Arceus will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.52A06CDA0FC6A1E7.title: "Arceus"
	quest.53125205A81148A3.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Regieleki you need either an \"Electric Golem Key\" or a \"Dragon Golem Key\". The \"Electric Golem Key\" is craftable with 1 Electric Gem and 4 \" Golem Ingots\" and batch of 4 \"Electric Golem Ingots\" is crafted using 1 Electric Gem and 4 \"Golem Scraps\" whereas the \"Dragon Golem Key\" is craftable with 1 Dragon Gem and 4 \" Golem Ingots\" and batch of 4 \"Dragon Golem Ingots\" is crafted using 1 Dragon Gem and 4 \"Golem Scraps\". \"Golem Scraps\" from furnace smelting \"Ancient Rubble\" found in caves at Deepslate level and below."
		""
		"Once you have either an \"Electric Golem Key\" or a \"Dragon Golem Key\", you can unlock the \"Elekidrago Lock\" found Snowpoint Temple (you can track it using the Arc Phone). Behind the lock will be a trial where you must rotate the four arrows in each of the colored item frames to match each of the arrows in the colored walls in each of the four corner crevices that you get to through a jumping obstacle course. Once each arrow matches, the wall between the middle two arrows will open the path that leads to Regieleki's and Regidrago's summon room."
		""
		"In the summon room, step on each circle to light it up. Once each circle is lit, both a level 40 Regieleki and a level 40 Regidrago will spawn, with a 2% chance of each being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Regirock Tablet\" which can be combined with the other 5 Tablets to craft the \"Titan key\", so you can obtain Regigigas."
	]
	quest.53125205A81148A3.title: "Regieleki / Regidraco"
	quest.5563A07D80A279F8.quest_desc: [
		"There you will gamble some balls and evolution items."
		""
		"20 apricorns with any colors to gamble!"
	]
	quest.5563A07D80A279F8.title: "Need balls ?"
	quest.564B275AA8E453DD.quest_desc: ["In life I love two things: Skyblock and Pokémon. So I decided to combine the two. "]
	quest.564B275AA8E453DD.title: "Cobblemon on Skyblock ?"
	quest.5680DF37F7E3CD50.quest_desc: ["Crafting Grids allow you to access your RS system as well as craft with items stored inside. There are grids that just allow access to the system and items, but Crafting Grids are just better."]
	quest.5814A5593826932D.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Virizion you must collect by right-clicking, 50 \"Virizion Footprints\" which you can find in any biome in the overworld."
		""
		"Once you collect your 50th footprint a level 40 Virizion will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive \"Special Leafy Greens\" upon summoning Virizion, which you'll be able to put together with the other 2 ingredients from Cobalion and Terrakion to craft the \"Curry of Justice\" to obtain Keldeo."
	]
	quest.5814A5593826932D.title: "Virizion (not created)"
	quest.5910DF0D168653E4.quest_desc: ["Just like Item disks, you can move onto much higher Fluid storage through Extra Disks"]
	quest.5913738A4480CB07.quest_desc: ["Craft a Rose Gold Seed."]
	quest.5AFE38ACD93F4585.quest_desc: ["To obtain lava, put campfire below fired crucible and put cobblestone into."]
	quest.5C13B5541D95B614.quest_desc: [
		"The beggining is the same as other Skyblock's modpacks. "
		""
		"You'll punch trees, collect some pebbles, sieve tons of gravel."
		""
		"But when you'll have your first ressources (diamonds, ender pearl, some pokeballs), you can also craft a teleporter, which will tp you on an Overworld dimension. But you'll see it later ;)"
	]
	quest.5CE87467378AE1F8.title: "Discover other mods"
	quest.5DF28B553E05A9E7.quest_desc: ["Put dust on water filled barrel to obtain clay."]
	quest.5ECE01738A2FA0B0.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Regirock, you need a \"Rock Golem Key\" craftable with 1 Rock Gem and 4 \"Rock Golem Ingots\". A batch of 4 \"Rock Golem Ingots\" is crafted using 1 Rock Gem and 4 \"Golem Scraps\" from furnace smelting \"Ancient Rubble\" found when sieving gravel in netherite mesh."
		""
		"Once you have a \"Rock Golem Key\", you can unlock the \"Regirock Lock\" found in Snowpoint Temple (you can track it using the Arc Phone). Behind the lock will be a trial where each block on the floor is lined with sand blocks and pressure plates. Right click the Note Block beside the entrance and the Redstone Lamps on the ceiling will light a path safe to walk on and any plate deviated from the path will fall to the water below with a ladder back at the entrance. Theres a ladder at the end of the path that leads to Regirock's summon room."
		""
		"In the summon room, step on each circle to light it up. Once each circle is lit, a level 40 Regirock will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Registeel Tablet\" upon lighting the floor which can be combined with the other 4 Tablets to craft the \"Titan Key\", so you can obtain Regigigas."
	]
	quest.5ECE01738A2FA0B0.title: "Regirock"
	quest.5F7C1C4908B43613.quest_desc: ["Virtually every block in RS requires a Machine Casing in the recipe. Make 3 right now to get a basic system going."]
	quest.5FDE51B2E7A48AFA.quest_desc: ["The Dark Collector [MK2] will generate 12 EMC/s, +3 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 192 EMC/s."]
	quest.5FDE51B2E7A48AFA.title: "Collector MK2"
	quest.60EA0C93F8C4EF92.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Meltan you must craft a \"Meltan Box\" and place it on the floor, after that, you need to fill the box with a total of 50 Metal Value, with the possible items being:"
		""
		"Copper Ingot -> 1 point"
		""
		"Iron Ingot -> 2 points"
		""
		"Gold Ingot -> 3 points"
		""
		"Netherite Ingot -> 50 points"
		""
		"After that, just right-click the box and a level 5 Meltan will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny (The Box won't be consumed), after that to evolve your Meltan into Melmetal, thanks to Mega Showdown you must get another 75 Meltans and release them, which will grant you an item (x75) to evolve Meltan by giving it to him."
	]
	quest.60EA0C93F8C4EF92.title: "Meltan / Melmetal"
	quest.611895B8E31ABAE7.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Chien-Pao you must collect by right-clicking, 8 \"Icerend Stakes\" which you can find in any biome in The Nether."
		""
		"Once you have collected at least 8 \"Icerend Stakes\" you can interact with a Icerend Shrine (you can track it using the Arc Phone) in The Nether, to summon a level 50 Chien-Pao, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.612247F8866643D5.quest_desc: ["The Energy Condenser MK2 is an upgraded version of the Energy Condenser."]
	quest.6158B25D9FCC7984.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Registeel you need a \"Steel Golem Key\" craftable with 1 Steel Gem and 4 \"Steel Golem Ingots\". A batch of 4 \"Steel Golem Ingots\" is crafted using 1 Steel Gem and 4 \"Golem Scraps\" from furnace smelting \"Ancient Rubble\" found when sieving gravel in netherite mesh."
		""
		"Once you have a \"Steel Golem Key\", you can unlock the \"Registeel Lock\" found in Snowpoint Temple (you can track it using the Arc Phone). Behind the lock will be a piston puzzle trial where the player must use buttons laid out on the floor to pulse the pistons beneath to push and pull the Redstone Block to the goal (the Gold Block). This will unlock the next puzzle with the same goal. Once all 5 puzzles are complete, a wall will come down reaveling the path that leads to Regirock's summon room. In the basement floor, there is an additional puzzle that leads to a treasure vault room."
		""
		"In the summon room, step on each circle to light it up. Once each circle is lit, a level 40 Registeel will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Registeel Tablet\" upon lighting the floor which can be combined with the other 4 Tablets to craft the \"Titan Key\", so you can obtain Regigigas."
	]
	quest.6158B25D9FCC7984.title: "Registeel"
	quest.61A65C82B7CBA8E1.quest_desc: ["The Violet Collector [MK7] will generate 10 240 EMC/s, +3 750 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 163 840 EMC/s."]
	quest.61A65C82B7CBA8E1.title: "Collector MK7"
	quest.627BCEAD3DCB722E.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Palkia you must find the Spear Pillar (you can track it using the Arc Phone), this is a huge greek style temple where you can obtain both Palkia and Dialga."
		""
		"Once you reach the Palkia Pedestal and use a \"Red Chain\", a level 70 Palkia will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Space Globe\" upon using the pedestal, which you'll be able to put together with the other 2 Globes and a Celestica Flute to craft the \"Azure Flute\" to obtain Arceus."
	]
	quest.627BCEAD3DCB722E.title: "Palkia"
	quest.63A8E4C8AE492BA9.quest_desc: ["Break infested leaves to have strings!"]
	quest.66A31A57555B5EC5.quest_desc: ["Craft a Pig Iron Seed."]
	quest.66F5B6DE94DFD61E.quest_desc: [
		"At this point you can move on to the Extra Disks mod, giving more and more space, up to Infinite space."
		""
	]
	quest.66F5B6DE94DFD61E.title: "More Storage"
	quest.67B5639277968D4A.quest_desc: ["Craft a Slimesteel Seed."]
	quest.6806723837D2AF13.quest_desc: ["Craft a Sapphire Seed."]
	quest.684235FE95A0F3CB.quest_desc: [
		"With you urn, defeat 50 similar type of urn."
		""
		"When filled, just right-click with it and Moltres will spawn (level 40)."
	]
	quest.684235FE95A0F3CB.title: "Moltres"
	quest.68CD0AA87E19EE23.quest_desc: ["Craft an Awakened Draconium Seed and his crux."]
	quest.6B0B95821343072A.quest_desc: ["Craft an Infinity Seed."]
	quest.6B2FCD3B9BE54DC5.quest_desc: ["The Basic Collector [MK1] will generate 4 EMC/s, +1 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 64 EMC/s."]
	quest.6B2FCD3B9BE54DC5.title: "Collector MK1"
	quest.6B423642DBBE0782.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Raikou you need to craft a \"Raikou Treat\", for which you will require multiple cobblemon berries and a \"Poketreat Box\" which the Entrepreneur Villager sometimes sells."
		""
		"Once you have the treat, you need to find the Burned Tower (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and place the treat at the Raikou Pedestal and a level 40 Raikou will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.6B423642DBBE0782.title: "Raikou"
	quest.6B7F034E4FB3092D.quest_desc: ["The Orange Collector [MK13] will generate 41 943 040 EMC/s, +15 360 000 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 671 088 640 EMC/s."]
	quest.6B7F034E4FB3092D.title: "Collector MK13"
	quest.6B8DEA53F6D8FE35.quest_desc: ["If you haven't gotten any slime to spawn from a mob farm, you can always put a magma cream into a Centrifugal Separator to get Slime and Blaze Powder. Slime has EMC, so it can be stored in the table and pulled out as needed."]
	quest.6C2A044E1F047311.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Uxie you must find Lake Acuity (you can track it using the Arc Phone). Defeat all the pokemon that are summoned by the Pokemon Trial Spawner within the Lake's cave to be rewarded with the item, \"Proof of Conquest (U)\"."
		""
		"Use \"Proof of Conquest (U)\" to summon Uxie with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Uxie Claw\" upon using the \"Proof of Conquest (U)\", which you'll be able to put together with the other 2 Guardian items to craft the \"Red Chain\" to obtain Dialga and Palkia."
	]
	quest.6C2A044E1F047311.title: "Uxie"
	quest.6C64ACBDBD600DBD.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Cresselia you must craft and use a \"Fullmoon Whistle\" using 5 \"Lunar Feathers\" obtained by sleeping with the \"Lucid Dreaming effect\" granted by sleeping near a \"Dream Catcher\"."
		""
		"Once you have the whistle just right-click with it in your hand and a level 50 Cresselia will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.6C64ACBDBD600DBD.title: "Cresselia (Not created)"
	quest.6D86FFBB32BA08FD.quest_desc: ["The Green Collector [MK10] will generate 655 360 EMC/s, +240 000 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 10 485 760 EMC/s."]
	quest.6D86FFBB32BA08FD.title: "Collector MK10"
	quest.6D921E8C6D1AA1A2.quest_desc: ["Same as gravel, just break with hammer"]
	quest.6F9CBA32C194B2DB.quest_desc: ["Pretty self explanatory -- this is the cable you need to connect all your RS devices together"]
	quest.70761C06ABE6EE12.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Cobalion you must collect by right-clicking, 50 \"Cobalion Footprints\" which you can find in any biome in the overworld."
		""
		"Once you collect your 50th footprint a level 40 Cobalion will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive \"Special Meat Chunks\" upon summoning Cobalion, which you'll be able to put together with the other 2 ingredients from Virizion and Terrakion to craft the \"Curry of Justice\" to obtain Keldeo."
	]
	quest.70761C06ABE6EE12.title: "Cobalion (not created)"
	quest.723DFEE62780BA88.quest_desc: ["The Lime Collector [MK11] will generate 2 621 440 EMC/s, +960 000 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 41 943 040 EMC/s."]
	quest.723DFEE62780BA88.title: "Collector MK11"
	quest.72AF05425AACD2EF.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Hoopa you must find the Hoopa Pyramid in The End (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and complete its trials (a maze, a fight, and quiz) to reach the last floor. On the last floor, you can obtain the \"Prison Bottle\" and the last \"Temple Key\""
		""
		"By placing those 2 items at the Hoopa Pedestals a level 60 Hoopa will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.72AF05425AACD2EF.title: "Hoopa"
	quest.753AC197E409EC30.quest_desc: ["Random pokemon will spawn and directly be in your team."]
	quest.756DD6A109B72788.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Suicune you need to craft a \"Suicune Treat\", for which you will require multiple cobblemon berries and a \"Poketreat Box\" which the Entrepreneur Villager sometimes sells."
		""
		"Once you have the treat, you need to find the Burned Tower (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and place the treat at the Suicune Pedestal and a level 40 Suicune will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
	]
	quest.756DD6A109B72788.title: "Suicune"
	quest.7609A4CA276586C0.quest_desc: ["Craft a Fluorite Seed."]
	quest.76CDDB0E6861E425.quest_desc: ["Craft a Ruby Seed."]
	quest.775DBBB285812CD3.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Latias you need to craft a \"Latias Treat\", for which you will require multiple cobblemon berries and a \"Poketreat Box\" which the Entrepreneur Villager sometimes sells."
		""
		"Once you have the treat, you need to find the Southern Island (you can track it using the Arc Phone) and place the treat at the Lati Pedestal and a level 50 Latias will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"Keep in mind that Latias and Latios share their pedestal, and you must choose between one or the other, and to obtain the other you will have to find another island."
	]
	quest.775DBBB285812CD3.title: "Latias"
	quest.795D8EA5B49AAFF3.quest_desc: ["The Lightium Coal will smelt 1 536 items."]
	quest.7A16E070DD57518B.quest_desc: [
		"With you urn, defeat 50 similar type of urn."
		""
		"When filled, just right-click with it and Articuno will spawn (level 40)."
	]
	quest.7A16E070DD57518B.title: "Articuno"
	quest.7AE7209CB4553AD2.quest_desc: [
		"With you urn, defeat 50 similar type of urn."
		""
		"When filled, just right-click with it and Zapdos will spawn (level 40)."
	]
	quest.7AE7209CB4553AD2.title: "Zapdos"
	quest.7CA7A1E77C950AC1.quest_desc: [
		"You can see all other balls in JEI."
		""
		"Certains balls have better effects depends to day/night, type of pokemon etc..."
	]
	quest.7CBB0BF15572CED5.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Azelf you must find Lake Valor (you can track it using the Arc Phone). Defeat all the pokemon that are summoned by the Pokemon Trial Spawner within the Lake's cave to be rewarded with the item, \"Proof of Conquest (A)\"."
		""
		"Use \"Proof of Conquest (A)\" to summon Azelf with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Azelf Fang\" upon using the \"Proof of Conquest (A)\", which you'll be able to put together with the other 2 Guardian items to craft the \"Red Chain\" to obtain Dialga and Palkia."
	]
	quest.7CBB0BF15572CED5.title: "Azelf"
	quest.7CC30FB271B1190C.quest_desc: ["Craft an Ironwood Seed."]
	quest.7D4CAEF28DBE4FE2.quest_desc: ["The Red Collector [MK3] will generate 40 EMC/s, +10 EMC/s for each relay, which can transfer 640 EMC/s."]
	quest.7D4CAEF28DBE4FE2.title: "Collector MK3"
	quest.7E4E21A742150C01.quest_desc: ["You can connect it to your storage system."]
	quest.7F19A6EFF27ABAE8.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Dialga you must find the Spear Pillar (you can track it using the Arc Phone), this is a huge greek style temple where you can obtain both Palkia and Dialga."
		""
		"Once you reach the Dialga Pedestal and use a \"Red Chain\", a level 70 Dialga will spawn, with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Time Globe\" upon using the pedestal, which you'll be able to put together with the other 2 Globes and a Celestica Flute to craft the \"Azure Flute\" to obtain Arceus."
	]
	quest.7F19A6EFF27ABAE8.title: "Dialga"
	quest.7F79A507617BD102.quest_desc: [
		"To obtain Mesprit you must find Lake Verity (you can track it using the Arc Phone). Defeat all the pokemon that are summoned by the Pokemon Trial Spawner within the Lake's cave to be rewarded with the item, \"Proof of Conquest (M)\"."
		""
		"Use \"Proof of Conquest (M)\" to summon Mesprit with a 2% chance of it being a shiny."
		""
		"You will also receive a \"Mesprit Plume\" upon using the \"Proof of Conquest (M)\", which you'll be able to put together with the other 2 Guardian items to craft the \"Red Chain\" to obtain Dialga and Palkia."
	]
	quest.7F79A507617BD102.title: "Mesprit"
